---

SpeedRead reimplements the RSVP reading technique from rapid-reader-extension
by ClaysonIO (https://github.com/ClaysonIO/rapid-reader-extension), also MIT
licensed. No source code was copied; the word-cleaning rules and the ~30% ORP
pivot heuristic are reused as described in that project.
